// triangulum -- the driver half of the RGB triangle.
//
// Like examples/initium.exsc, this is where authority enters: once, as
// the `Mundus` parameter (§4.1 rule 2), and everything below it derives
// from that value. pictura.exsc's rasterizer is pure arithmetic; this
// file hands it the standard-output writer and turns its framebuffer
// into the P6 stream on stdout. The audit in the suite (per §10.3)
// reads the capability off the interface: the program's syscall surface
// is write(1) and exit_group.
//
// The image's pixels are decided before a byte is written: the
// computation is fixed-order f64 arithmetic under nearest-even, so the
// differential phase over gcc/clang at -O0/-O2 (tests/run.sh) and the
// Python oracle (prototypes/pictura_oracle.py) both reproduce it.

publica functio initium(m: Mundus) -> u8 {
    firma a = m.ambitus();
    sub ambitus = a;
    firma s = Scriptor.ad_exitum(a);
    firma n = exscribe(s);
    si n ne 15565 {
        redde 1;
    }
    redde 0;
}